The '''nechryarch''' is a [[superior]] variant of [[nechryael]] and [[greater nechryael]]. It has a chance of spawning after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point]]s from any [[Slayer master]].

Like nechryael, nechryarch can summon minions to assist it in battle. It will summon 3 [[chaotic death spawn]]s, with each one attacking with magic, ranged and melee. These spawns hit harder, but their attacks can be successfully prayed against. Like normal death spawns, [[Single-way_combat#(Chaotic)_death_spawns|they ignore combat restrictions]]. As players will be subjected to all three forms of combat with very high damage, a common tactic is to run away from the spawns until they lose interest and repeat until the nechryarch dies. Alternatively, they can be killed with [[area-of-effect]] attacks in the [[Catacombs of Kourend]].

Like their standard counterparts, the chaotic death spawns will not be summoned if the nechryarch is unable to attack the player back (such as when being [[safespot]]ted).

The [[Slayer Tower]] Basement has many tables which makes safespotting the nechryarch very easy and makes slaying them a lot safer. Even if meleeing the Nechryael it is worth bringing a range weapon or runes for a magic spell to kill any nechryarch that spawn.

Once the nechryarch dies, the most recent set of chaotic death spawns they summoned will immediately despawn. Any other sets will despawn in a short period of time.

