==Trivia==
* Their in-game models resemble and they use the same animations as [[giants]], similarly to [[abhorrent spectre]]s. Likewise, when idle (not moving) they remain completely static.
* They are the only superior slayer monster that spawns for both their normal and stronger counterparts, although they do have different drop tables depending on which variant was killed.
* Although the nechryarchs cannot be attacked by the other players, their chaotic death spawns can be fought by anyone.

